WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
System, please unblock the hotel.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,050
Why did you appear suddenly?

3
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:08,050
I was shocked

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:10,050
It's nothing. I just went out for something.

5
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:17,620
Okay, then I'll go back too

6
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,620
It's time to work hard to upgrade

7
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:23,140
Expanded territory

8
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,140
I feel tired just looking at it

9
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:28,140
I really want to find another employee to help me.

10
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:35,010
Bear, wipe the seat

11
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:41,580
Disinfected again

12
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:43,580
This is what you call a decent meal
